ch06.chart:
flowchart TD
  Q1{"Shape fixed while handle is alive?"}
  Q1 -->|yes| R["use &T, &mut T, or a slice"]
  Q1 -->|no| Q2{"Need a stable address, not just a position?"}
  Q2 -->|no| I["use an index or typed ID, reborrow later"]
  Q2 -->|yes| Q3{"Few elements or graph-like with churn?"}
  Q3 -->|few| Bx["Vec of Box T: stable pointees"]
  Q3 -->|churn| Ar["arena or slab: access by ID"]

ch07.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Need this value again?] --> Borrow{Can the next step borrow?}
  Borrow -->|yes| UseRef[Pass &T or &mut T]
  Borrow -->|no, needs to own| Move{Single owner moving on?}
  Move -->|yes| DoMove[Move it]
  Move -->|no, need a duplicate| Dup{Type is Copy?}
  Dup -->|yes| DoCopy[Implicit copy]
  Dup -->|no| Independent{Independent owner needed?}
  Independent -->|yes| DoClone[clone explicitly]
  Independent -->|no, just shared reads| DoShare[Rc or Arc clone]

ch09.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Need indirection or sharing] --> Owners{How many owners}
  Owners -->|one| Box[Box T]
  Owners -->|many| Threads{One thread or many}
  Threads -->|one thread| Rc[Rc T]
  Threads -->|many threads| Arc[Arc T]
  Rc --> Mut1{Need shared mutation}
  Mut1 -->|small copy or swap| Cell[wrap in Cell]
  Mut1 -->|dynamic borrows| RefCell[wrap in RefCell]
  Arc --> Mut2{Need shared mutation}
  Mut2 -->|yes| Mutex[wrap in Mutex]
  Box --> Move{Must it stop moving}
  Move -->|yes| Pin[Pin Box T]

ch15.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Modeling need] --> Q1{Set of cases closed?}
  Q1 -->|Yes, a fixed lifecycle| Enum[Enum plus match]
  Q1 -->|No, plugins added later| Dyn[Trait object dyn Trait]
  Start --> Q2{Sharing data or behavior?}
  Q2 -->|Shared data| Comp[Compose a field]
  Q2 -->|Shared behavior| Trait[Implement a trait]
  Start --> Q3{Hiding representation?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Mod[Module plus private fields]

ch19.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Pick a format for this boundary] --> Q1{Must a human read it?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Config or data stream?}
  Q2 -->|Config| Toml[TOML or YAML]
  Q2 -->|Data or API| Json[JSON]
  Q1 -->|No| Q3{Same document model, smaller?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Cbor[MessagePack or CBOR]
  Q3 -->|Need cross-language schema| Schema[Schema-first binary]

ch20.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Repetition spotted] --> Q1{Variation is values, types, or behavior?}
  Q1 -->|yes| Fn[Function, generic, trait, or enum]
  Q1 -->|no, it is syntax| Q2{Source of truth external or surface large?}
  Q2 -->|yes| Gen[Build script or offline generator]
  Q2 -->|no| Q3{Needs item structure or attributes?}
  Q3 -->|no, local pattern| Decl[macro_rules!]
  Q3 -->|yes| Proc[Procedural macro]

ch29.chart:
flowchart TD
  V[Value to cross] --> Q1{Is it a number?}
  Q1 -->|yes| N[Pass directly, no copy]
  Q1 -->|no| Q2{Crosses often with big payload?}
  Q2 -->|yes| H[Keep resident, pass a handle]
  Q2 -->|no| Q3{Flat bytes or string?}
  Q3 -->|yes| C[Copy slice or string]
  Q3 -->|rich struct| S[Serialize then copy]
